  book_index: 0
  book_title: For Whom Did the Roses Bloom That Night?
  book_color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  book_clue_index: 116
  content: 
  clue_content: "This seems like a terribly dull romance novel. Wait\u2026\nSomeone
    has scribbled a note on one of the pages:\n\n\u201CLinda, are you reading this?
    Their story makes me miss you more than ever. I miss the days when we read A
    Veil of Dreams, a Lifetime of Love together. You\u2019d write a line, then I\u2019d
    write one back. We spoke to each other through the pages.\u201D"
